Title: Trust in police in Peterborough area improves thanks to project
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Peterborough City Council', 'Text': 'Peterborough City Council said the Alliance project centred on Lincoln Road in Millfield had led to increased confidence in policing and a "700% increase in community intelligence reporting".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 176}}, {'Speaker': 'The council', 'Text': 'The council says 700,000 illegal cigarettes have been seized in the area, as well as 20,000 vapes and £115,000 in cash.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 104}}, {'Speaker': 'Insp Sam Tucker, from Cambridgeshire Police', 'Text': 'We can definitely use some of the concepts in there but to use this initiative in its entirety is unlikely.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 16, 'StartChar': 83, 'EndChar': 180}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Trust in police in a city centre community has risen as a result of a project aimed at fighting organised crime, a council has said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 101}}, {'Description': 'New drug needle bins were also installed.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 7, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 36}}, {'Description': 'However, in the report by the council to a scrutiny committee on Thursday, external, Alliance struggled to make inroads with local groups.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 110}}, {'Description': 'Police said the agencies involved in Alliance would continue to look for funding for the project in Millfield, but would not immediately implement it elsewhere in the city as it was an "intense project about longevity and sustainability".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 15, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 210}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Lincoln Road stretches ahead with white road markings. On the far side is a line of shops and other businesses, with several people leaning against a silver metal gate in front of them. In the distance, cars are parked along the road. A pedestrian crossing bisects the road, with traffic lights showing red in front of it.'}]}
